# Cloudflare Pages headers.
# COOP/COEP enable SharedArrayBuffer → threaded WASM. The current ffmpeg core is
# single-thread (works without COEP); these are set ahead of a future threaded core.
# All app assets are same-origin, so require-corp is safe. See architecture.md.
/*
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Cross-Origin-Embedder-Policy: require-corp
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
